body:
I&#39;m really getting into submitting my day&#39;s accomplishments; great motivator for me! However there are a couple bugs. I have no &#39;Pets&#39; tab, and can&#39;t equip any as a result! Also, rearranging list items makes them glitch.
A suggestion I have: an option for long-term tracking of activities, such as &#34;went to gym 7 times in February, 9 times in March... etc.&#34;
Thank you!

This app is fantastic for getting things done and also great for personal growth. You get to adjust your personal goals and their value in terms of difficulty. I&#39;ve been able to keep track of good and bad habits in my life and it makes me be more aware of what I&#39;m doing since it affects my avatar. What really makes this app great is the party system. If you goof up, not only does it punish you, but people in your party as well. The accountability works extremely well! You feel like you can&#39;t fail your teammates and thus get on top of what you need to do!

The only thing that I would love to see improve is getting notifications on party messages. I do like how you can message your party, but there aren&#39;t any push notifications to alert you. I would like this not only for faster communication, but it helps for communicating  things like, &#34;Hey party, which quest do you guys want to tackle next?&#34; 

Overall great app and I&#39;ll continue to use it for a VERY long time! For real, grab friends in on this. Teamwork is dreamwork!
